<title>INDIA: India Orchid Chem 96/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India Orchid Chem 96/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     306.5     vs	   173.7</p>
<p>    Net sales	    1,925.3     vs	 1,118.8</p>
<p>    Other income	    22.1     vs	    32.7</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  1,408.8     vs	   875.0</p>
<p>    Interest		 156.5     vs	    75.2</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   382.0     vs	   201.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    71.7     vs	    27.7</p>
<p>    Tax			  3.8     vs	    Nil</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	17.67     vs	   10.29</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	  4.0     vs	     2.5</p>
<p>Note - Orchid Chemicals &amp; Pharmaceuticals Ltd is based in southern Madras. The latest results are audited. As on March 31, 1997, the book value stood at 66.61 rupees against 53.34 a year ago, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
